CHTicTacToe
Copyright 2026 bateske

From CHBlackjack (https://github.com/bateske/CHBlackjack, Apache-2.0): the
input and frame pacing (src/CHGame.*), palette, drawing, outlined
lettering, effects, sound sequencer, flash saving, debug protocol, the PC
simulator and tools, the table's wall and rail, the chips, the croupier
(the dealer from CHBlackjack's tables, with his expressions) and the
end-screen lettering, adapted here by way of CHRoulette.

CHBlackjack is a derivative of "Blackjack" for the Arduboy by Press Play On
Tape - Simon Holmes (filmote), code, and Stephane C (vampirics), art
(https://github.com/Press-Play-On-Tape/Blackjack, Apache-2.0). The croupier
is Press Play On Tape's dealer, recoloured and retouched by hand; the "YOU
WON THE BANK" and "YOU ARE BROKE" lettering and the 3x5 pixel font in
src/gfx/Draw.cpp are Press Play On Tape's.

From CHChess (https://github.com/bateske/CHChess, Apache-2.0): the pointing
glove, the soft clock ticks and the shake routine.

Everything else - the rules of the sixteen tables, the dealer's play, the
match flow, the felts and marks, the cat, the title lettering (drafted from
the Arial Black and Georgia typefaces by tools/make_logo.py) and the
presentation - is new, under the Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE).
